# Experimental Synthesizer's enter trigger exiles the top card of Bot1's library (Mox Sapphire) and Bot1 casts it from exile
# the same turn. On turn 3 the sorcery-speed ability, paid with exactly three Moxen ({2}{R}, nothing floating after),
# sacrifices it: the leaves-the-battlefield trigger exiles the next card (a Mountain, the turn's land drop, played under the
# ordinary land rules) and the ability makes a 2/2 white Samurai with vigilance. In Bot1's own upkeep, the Moxen untapped, the ability is
# refused: "Activate only as a sorcery" (CR 602.5d, 307.5).

